		(property "Part Origin" "Exact-MPN symbol created by Steve. Reuses the unchanged reviewed OCPM managed C_0402_1005Metric footprint and generic model under the standard passive-package exception. KYOCERA AVX standard 0402 nominal 1.00 x 0.50 mm body, maximum height 0.56 mm; unpolarized end terminals. Retained IPC-style lands are 0.56 x 0.62 mm at X +/-0.48 mm, gap 0.40 mm. AVX mounting guide recommends 0.60 x 0.50 mm lands, gap 0.50 mm, overall 1.70 mm. Shared 0402 lands span 1.52 mm and are wider transversely. This is the existing reviewed generic package selection, not claimed identical to AVX recommended lands; exact-part assembly review remains required. Generic model is 1.00 x 0.50 x 0.50 mm. It is a nominal visualization, NOT the 0.56 mm maximum-height clearance envelope; use the exact datasheet for height clearance. Original unique draft package and evidence retained in private shared-reuse migration recovery storage. No prior Spec verification is transferred."
			(at 2.54 -1.27 0)
			(effects hide
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Migration Notes" "Nominal capacitance, voltage, dielectric, tolerance and size match historical P-00029 context. New exact-MPN Part; no inherited verification, stock guarantee, oscillator qualification, substitution approval or project changes."
