		(property "Part Origin" "Exact-MPN symbol created by Steve. Reuses the unchanged reviewed OCPM managed R_0402_1005Metric footprint and generic model under the standard passive-package exception. TE CPF0402 nominal body 1.00 x 0.50 x 0.30 mm, two nonpolar end terminals. Shared IPC-style lands 0.54 x 0.64 mm at X +/-0.51 mm, gap 0.48 mm. TE recommended 0402 lands are 0.50 x 0.60 mm with 0.50 mm gap. Slightly larger shared lands retain the two-terminal mapping; generic-package choice is explicit and still subject to exact-part review. Generic model 1.00 x 0.50 x 0.35 mm is an approximation 0.05 mm taller than nominal; not an exact manufacturing model. Original unique draft package and evidence retained in private shared-reuse migration recovery storage. No prior Spec verification is transferred."
