		(property "Part Origin" "Exact-MPN symbol created by Steve. Reuses the unchanged reviewed OCPM managed C_0805_2012Metric footprint and generic model under the standard passive-package exception. Murata GRM21B nominal body 2.00 x 1.25 x 1.25 mm; unpolarized two end terminals. Retained IPC-style lands are 1.00 x 1.45 mm at X +/-0.95 mm (0.90 mm gap). Murata p26 recommends 0.6-0.8 x 1.2-1.4 mm lands with 1.2 mm gap. The shared footprint uses wider lands with the same 1.90 mm nominal pitch as the manufacturer-range midpoint. Selected as the existing reviewed generic 0805 package, not represented as an exact copy of Murata recommended geometry; assembly choice remains visible for exact-part review. Existing generic model bounding box 2.00 x 1.25 x 1.25 mm agrees with nominal body; idealized terminals and no internal construction. Original unique draft package and evidence retained in private shared-reuse migration recovery storage. No prior Spec verification is transferred."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(effects hide
