		(property "Capacitance Measurement Conditions" "22 uF +/-10% measured at room temperature, 120+/-24 Hz, 0.5+/-0.1 Vrms (p3); X7R +/-15% over -55..125 C, reference 25 C, no bias. DC bias, AC amplitude, aging and temperature affect capacitance; 22 uF is not guaranteed in circuit at 25 V DC. No numerical effective capacitance under DC bias established from this specification; application-specific evaluation required."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Voltage Conditions" "25 V maximum continuous; with AC superimposed on DC, greater of peak-to-peak or zero-to-peak must remain within rating (p3). Include self-heating in maximum operating temperature; p11 requires body self-heating below 20 C at 25 C ambient."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Historical Requirements Comparison" "Nominal 22 uF, 25 V, X7R, +/-10%, 1210 match historical context only. Actual capacitance is test-condition dependent and not a guaranteed 22 uF at operating DC bias. Maximum body height 2.70 mm; shared land departure requires human assembly review. No interchangeability or legacy qualification inherited."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Part Origin" "New standalone exact-MPN migration from legacy P-00017; no inherited verification or substitute approval. Symbol from KiCad Device:C. Reused reviewed managed Capacitor_SMD:C_1210_3225Metric package unchanged. Provisional centered geometric fit only, not placement-tolerance or solder-process qualification. Unchanged catalog pads 1/2 at x=-/+1.475 mm, 1.15 x 2.70 mm, roundrect; inner gap 1.80 mm. Minimum 0.30 mm end strips at body length extremes occupy positive x=1.15..1.45 and 1.45..1.75 mm (negative mirrored), within land x=0.90..2.05 mm. Land transverse span +/-1.35 mm accommodates maximum body width 2.70 mm; rounded corners do not invalidate central end-strip overlap. Courtyard +/-2.30 x +/-1.60 mm encloses maximum body +/-1.75 x +/-1.35 mm. Retained gap 1.80 mm differs from Murata p27 recommendation 2.0..2.4 mm, width 2.70 differs from 1.8..2.3 mm; length 1.15 is within 1.0..1.2 mm. NOT manufacturer-recommended geometry. Unchanged reviewed mask/paste retained; no new stencil rules. Per user provisional assessment, exact-part human review must assess assembly deviation and solder amount before verification: p27 requires actual PCB evaluation; p16 warns excessive solder stresses/cracks MLCCs. No assembly approval or waiver implied. Unchanged catalog generic STEP independently measured 3.20 x 2.50 x 2.50 mm, z=0..2.50 mm. Matches nominal body envelope only; not manufacturer exact CAD and does not represent dimensional tolerances, exact terminal metallization or solder fillets. Use actual 2.70 mm maximum body height for clearance, plus application mounting allowance, not nominal model appearance. Existing package integrity copied without new approval."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
